  "description": "<p style=\"font-size: 14px; font-weight: normal; text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">The&nbsp;Terrax Barefoot footwear is designed to offer the most natural walking experience possible, combining features that focus on comfort, foot health, and freedom of movement. The main features of Terrax Barefoot are:</span></p>\r\n<ol style=\"text-align: justify;\">\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Zero Drop: A completely flat sole that promotes a more natural and balanced posture, helping to reduce joint pressure and encouraging healthy walking.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Wide Toe Box: With a spacious design in the front, it allows your toes to spread naturally, providing more comfort and preventing any pressure or discomfort.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Flexible Structure: The footwear is highly flexible, allowing the foot to move naturally and adapt to the terrain, as if walking barefoot.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Lightweight: Its lightweight construction ensures a feeling of freedom, ideal for walking long distances or engaging in outdoor activities without the added weight of conventional footwear.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Breathability: Breathable materials that allow air circulation, keeping your feet fresh and dry throughout the day, even during long periods of wear.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Slip-Resistant Grip: A sole designed to provide excellent traction on various surfaces, offering stability and security when walking or running.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Durability: Despite being lightweight and flexible, Terrax Barefoot shoes are built with durable materials, ensuring long-lasting wear and performance over time.</span></p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ol>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: 10pt;\">Terrax Barefoot is the perfect choice for those looking for minimalist, comfortable, and functional footwear that respects foot anatomy and promotes an active and healthy lifestyle.</span></p>",
